ras/d3e1a06e7c131c53bb5b5b997e50f488.mp4?t=1769479584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wanted to directly attack enemies in the background in 2.5D side scroller games?  Now you can, just switch the perspective angle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411930/extras/4085b8933ccb4bf9792c275b49094b94.poster.avif?t=1769479584\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411930/extras/4085b8933ccb4bf9792c275b49094b94.webm?t=1769479584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411930/extras/4085b8933ccb4bf9792c275b49094b94.mp4?t=1769479584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss encounters</strong> require switching between overhead and side scrolling perspectives to adapt to attacks coming from any direction.  Balance the strengths and weaknesses of each perspective for each situation to achieve victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411930/extras/1c12d6b97cc5a7932f5f4eb5a68bcf5e.poster.avif?t=1769479584\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411930/extras/1c12d6b97cc5a7932f5f4eb5a68bcf5e.webm?t=1769479584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411930/extras/1c12d6b97cc5a7932f5f4eb5a68bcf5e.mp4?t=1769479584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can't judge the platform in isometric view?\u00a0 No problem!\u00a0 You\u2019ll never want to be locked down to a single perspective again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411930/extras/fe6ee2269338d59c2a6f70eacb6a3da2.poster.avif?t=1769479584\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411930/extras/fe6ee2269338d59c2a6f70eacb6a3da2.webm?t=1769479584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411930/extras/fe6ee2269338d59c2a6f70eacb6a3da2.mp4?t=1769479584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is powered by the Rift Forge Engine, custom built from the ground up and optimized for this voxel perspective change mechanic.\u00a0 It is tuned to run at high details with raytracing at high frame rates, even on budget iGPU hardware.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411930/extras/18f9aa1013a33eb8f384bd67b9b2866b.avif?t=1769479584\" width=512 height=256 /></span></p>","developers":["Matt Edzenga"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411930/e8e69a0175ddc1cb516ac811dbbe55bd2adb0c37/header.jpg?t=1769479584","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.a